# s05c — the all-quantifier and the empty fiber, split from 013-set-hop (mirrors demos/1-selection/012-empty-pen.bqn)
# Animals rows 0-4, pens rows 5-8 in one id space; the .bqn keeps pens as their own 0-3 index space.
# penOf is functional (animal -> pen); livestock = inv penOf. Pen 8 holds no animals: the empty fiber.
n 9
rel penOf 5 5 6 6 7 -1 -1 -1 -1
inv livestock penOf
col healthy bool 1 1 1 0 1 0 0 0 0
col pen bool 0 0 0 0 0 1 1 1 1
col certified bool 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col headcount num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
ja 所属囲い penOf
ja 家畜 livestock
ja 健康 healthy
ja 囲い pen
ja 認証 certified
ja 頭数 headcount
